<title>CANADA: Intl Murex Q4 shr net turns to profit.</title>
<headline>Intl Murex Q4 shr net turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit     US$0.11     loss     US$0.08</p>
<p> Net	 profit	 1,840     loss	 1,320</p>
<p> Revs			24,680		   24,188</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit     US$0.11     loss     US$0.40</p>
<p> Net	 profit	 1,849     loss	 6,610</p>
<p> Revs		     100,851		   92,394</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,511		   16,381</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is International Murex Technologies Corp. 1995 results included a charge of US$3.1 million, or US$0.19 per share, in litigation settlements of the 1992 class action suits and other actions.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
